Modifications made to the original template:

- Content, branding, logo and photographs replaced with those of the
  Regional Center for Retraining and Advanced Training of Pedagogical Staff
  at Samarkand State University (pages index.html, about.html, contact.html
  in Uzbek; the navigation to the other template pages was commented out).
- Page language set to Uzbek (lang="uz") on the customized pages.
- Images in img/ recompressed (JPEG quality ~80, metadata stripped, large
  images downscaled; logo PNGs resized and palette-optimized).
- Fixed broken local paths (missing favicon on template pages; empty footer,
  breadcrumb and call-to-action links on the customized pages).
- Accessibility improvements: aria-labels for icon-only links and buttons,
  alt text for images, aria-current on the active navigation link,
  aria-controls/aria-expanded on the navbar toggler, labels for carousel
  controls, visible keyboard focus outlines (css/style.css), and support for
  prefers-reduced-motion (css/style.css, js/main.js: no WOW animations, no
  carousel autoplay, no animated scroll-to-top).
- Lazy loading (loading="lazy", decoding="async") for below-the-fold images.
- Replaced the unsupported "sr-only" class with Bootstrap 5 "visually-hidden".

The third-party libraries in lib/ (animate.css, Easing, OwlCarousel2,
Waypoints, WOW.js) and css/bootstrap.min.css (Bootstrap) retain their own
licenses.
